{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600010","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1260001001:1":{"text":"에, 에, 에취! \n우와, 날씨가 점점 더 추워지고 있어. 곧 겨울이 오려나 봐!","source_cn":"啊、啊、啊啾——\\n呜哇，天越来越冷了，感觉快到冬天了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6E0B27F486C286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260001002:1":{"text":"그러게, 벌써 11월이라니... 시간이 너무 빨리 가. 신밧드와 모험을 했던 게 바로 엊그제였던 것 같은데 말이야...","source_cn":"对哦，很快就要到十一月了……时间过得好快啊，感觉和辛巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x716FAD693F190E26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260001003:1":{"text":"이봐! 누가 내 이름을 부르는 것 같은데! 오랜만이야, 친구들!","source_cn":"嘿！我听到有人在叫我的名字！好久不见，亲爱的朋友们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF87D681A689E9839","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260001004:1":{"text":"자, 이건 선물!","source_cn":"拿着，给你们的礼物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA08D80ABD46D58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260001005:1":{"text":"아! 해바라기씨랑 견과류네요! 게다가 다른 맛도 있어요!","source_cn":"啊！是葵花籽和坚果！而且还有不同口味的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3297E9B5BDAE120B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1260001006:1":{"text":"그리고 수를 놓은 작은 손수건과 비수까지... 고마워요, 신밧드!","source_cn":"还有刺绣的小手帕和小匕首——谢谢你，辛巴达！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03F4374D8249D59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1260001007:1":{"text":"손수건의 자수가 엄청 정교해요... 신밧드, 이건 어디서 구한 거예요?","source_cn":"这手帕的刺绣很精细呢……看着像是王都的手艺。辛巴达，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D100DE6E9A58E8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260001008:1":{"text":"헤헤, 시간 날 때 다른 사람의 배를 타고 바다에 몇 번 나갔다 오면서 사 온 거야.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，我抽时间搭别人的船出了几次海。从外面淘换来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA32199F1FCC4F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1260001008":{"text":"헤헤, 시간 날 때 다른 사람의 배를 타고 바다에 몇 번 나갔다 오면서 사 온 거야.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，我抽时间搭别人的船出了几次海。从外面淘换来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA32199F1FCC4F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1260001009:0":{"text":"헤헤, 물론 대마법사 것도 있지!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，当然，也少不了大魔法师的——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x536D8829C25D4BE1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"헤헤, 물론 대마법사 것도 있지!","female":"헤헤, 물론 대마법사 것도 있지!","variant_male_record_index":"140081","varian